<title>UK: Tokai Finance sets 20 bln yen step-up FRN.</title>
<headline>Tokai Finance sets 20 bln yen step-up FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Tokai Bank Europe Plc.</p>
<p> BORROWER   TOKAI FINANCE (CURACAO) NV</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  TOKAI BANK</p>
<p> AMT    20 BLN YEN    BASE	 6M-LIBOR  MATURITY    UNDATED</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN   **+70 BP    PAY DATE    25.FEB.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;PY =	   ISS PRICE  PAR	 FULL FEES   30 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	**UNTIL 25.FEB.02, 6M LIBOR +130 BP TO 25.FEB.07</p>
<p>	     6M LIBOR +180 BP THEREAFTER</p>
<p>		CALLABLE AT PAR FROM FEB.02</p>
<p> LISTING    NONE	DENOMS (M) 100	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  JAPAN     TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    =	   SELL CONC  =	   PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
